<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="자료구조와 알고리즘 12주 84일 통합 심화 커리큘럼">
  <title>Data Structures &amp; Algorithms · 12주 84일</title>
  <style>
    :root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#100d07;--panel:#1c170c;--line:#433719;--text:#fff8e7;--muted:#c5b894;--accent:#fbbf24;--blue:#7dd3fc}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 82% 0,#3b2b06 0,transparent 30%),var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:16px/1.72 system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
    a{color:var(--accent)}.wrap{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:auto}.hero{padding:72px 0 40px}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.14em}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,5.4rem);line-height:1.02;margin:.15em 0}.hero p{max-width:820px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.14rem}.buttons{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}.button{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 16px;text-decoration:none;background:#171205}.primary{border-color:var(--accent)}
    .metrics,.grid{display:grid;gap:16px}.metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin:20px 0 48px}.metric,.card,.week,.flow{border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(28,23,12,.94);border-radius:18px}.metric{padding:20px}.metric b{display:block;color:var(--accent);font-size:1.65rem}.metric span,.muted{color:var(--muted)}section{margin:54px 0}h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.8rem);margin-bottom:12px}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.card{padding:22px}.card h3,.week h3{margin-top:0}.flow{padding:22px;overflow:auto}.pipeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(135px,1fr));gap:10px;min-width:900px}.node{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:15px;background:#151104}.node b{display:block;color:var(--accent)}
    .weeks{display:grid;gap:16px}.week{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr;padding:22px}.week-no{color:var(--accent);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.1em}.week ol{columns:2;gap:36px;margin-bottom:0}.week li{break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:6px}.review{border-left:4px solid var(--blue)}footer{padding:24px 0 72px;color:var(--muted)}
    @media(max-width:760px){.metrics,.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.week{grid-template-columns:1fr}.week ol{columns:1}.hero{padding-top:44px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">DATA STRUCTURES × ALGORITHMS</div>
      <h1>문제에서 선택까지,<br>근거가 끊기지 않게.</h1>
      <p>자료구조 이름과 풀이 패턴을 외우지 않습니다. 필요한 연산, 입력 분포, 표현 불변식, 복잡도, 정당성, cache와 allocation 비용을 한 흐름으로 연결합니다.</p>
      <div class="buttons"><a class="button primary" href="daily/">일일 학습 아카이브</a><a class="button" href="#weeks">84일 전체 보기</a></div>
    </header>

    <section class="metrics">
      <article class="metric"><b>12주</b><span>기초부터 production 선택까지</span></article>
      <article class="metric"><b>84일</b><span>구현·증명·실패·리뷰</span></article>
      <article class="metric"><b>12개</b><span>통합 랩과 면접 리뷰</span></article>
      <article class="metric"><b>1개 흐름</b><span>자료구조와 알고리즘 통합</span></article>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>선택을 만드는 architecture</h2>
      <p class="muted">좋은 답은 “hash map이 빠르다”가 아니라 아래 결정 사슬을 끊김 없이 방어합니다.</p>
      <div class="flow"><div class="pipeline">
        <div class="node"><b>Problem</b>입출력·제약·성공 조건</div>
        <div class="node"><b>Operations</b>lookup/insert/order/range 빈도</div>
        <div class="node"><b>Representation</b>layout, invariant, ownership</div>
        <div class="node"><b>Algorithm</b>상태 전이와 correctness</div>
        <div class="node"><b>Cost</b>time, space, locality, allocation</div>
        <div class="node"><b>Evidence</b>test, benchmark, failure case</div>
      </div></div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>코딩 테스트를 넘어서는 세 축</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card"><h3>Invariant</h3><p class="muted">연산 전후에 반드시 참이어야 하는 조건으로 구현과 proof를 연결합니다.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Adversarial Input</h3><p class="muted">최악 분포, overflow, collision, recursion depth, concurrency를 오류 모델에 포함합니다.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Production Cost</h3><p class="muted">Big-O뿐 아니라 cache miss, allocation, serialization, contention과 운영 복잡도를 비교합니다.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="weeks">
      <h2>12주 · 84일</h2>
      <div class="weeks">
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 1</div><div><h3>문제 모델과 복잡도</h3><ol><li>ADT/structure/algorithm/program</li><li>cost model과 점근 표기</li><li>worst/average/amortized</li><li>correctness/invariant</li><li>recursion/recurrence</li><li>표현별 benchmark</li><li>분석과 측정 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 2</div><div><h3>Sequence</h3><ol><li>array/locality</li><li>dynamic array</li><li>linked list</li><li>stack</li><li>queue/deque/ring buffer</li><li>bounded queue 랩</li><li>연산 빈도 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 3</div><div><h3>Hashing</h3><ol><li>hash/bucket/load factor</li><li>chaining/open addressing</li><li>probing/tombstone</li><li>resize/amortized</li><li>equality와 공격 입력</li><li>hash map 구현</li><li>시스템 연결 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 4</div><div><h3>Trees and Ordered Structures</h3><ol><li>tree/traversal</li><li>BST invariant</li><li>AVL/Red-Black</li><li>heap</li><li>trie</li><li>scheduler queue 랩</li><li>ordered map 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 5</div><div><h3>Storage-oriented Trees</h3><ol><li>B-tree/B+tree</li><li>LSM tree</li><li>Bloom filter</li><li>compaction/amplification</li><li>index/selectivity</li><li>KV store 랩</li><li>DB index 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 6</div><div><h3>Sorting and Selection</h3><ol><li>정렬 속성</li><li>기초 정렬</li><li>merge sort</li><li>quicksort</li><li>heap/counting/radix</li><li>분포별 benchmark</li><li>정렬 하한 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 7</div><div><h3>Searching and Divide-and-Conquer</h3><ol><li>binary search invariant</li><li>bounds/parametric search</li><li>recurrence</li><li>quickselect</li><li>two pointers/window</li><li>off-by-one 실험</li><li>검색 모델링 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 8</div><div><h3>Graph Foundations</h3><ol><li>graph representation</li><li>BFS</li><li>DFS/topological</li><li>disjoint set</li><li>MST</li><li>dependency scheduler 랩</li><li>traversal 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 9</div><div><h3>Shortest Path and Flow</h3><ol><li>Dijkstra</li><li>Bellman-Ford</li><li>Floyd-Warshall</li><li>DAG shortest path</li><li>max flow/min cut</li><li>조건별 선택 랩</li><li>shortest path 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 10</div><div><h3>Greedy and Dynamic Programming</h3><ol><li>greedy proof</li><li>interval/Huffman</li><li>DP state/transition</li><li>memo/tabulation</li><li>knapsack/sequence</li><li>최소 반례 랩</li><li>proof 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week"><div class="week-no">WEEK 11</div><div><h3>Strings and Randomization</h3><ol><li>string/Unicode</li><li>KMP</li><li>rolling hash</li><li>suffix structure</li><li>randomized expected cost</li><li>log search 랩</li><li>확률 trade-off 리뷰</li></ol></div></article>
        <article class="week review"><div class="week-no">WEEK 12</div><div><h3>Production Selection and Interview</h3><ol><li>memory hierarchy</li><li>concurrency/contention</li><li>persistence</li><li>benchmark/profiler</li><li>validation/adversarial input</li><li>scheduler/rate limiter 캡스톤</li><li>최종 defense</li></ol></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>답변 품질 루브릭</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card"><h3>Level 1 · 구현</h3><p class="muted">자료구조 API와 대표 알고리즘을 구현하고 복잡도를 말한다.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Level 2 · 증명</h3><p class="muted">invariant, 반례, amortized analysis로 정확성과 비용을 설명한다.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Level 3 · Production</h3><p class="muted">분포, locality, allocation, concurrency, failure와 운영 비용까지 선택을 방어한다.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="wrap">MIT OpenCourseWare와 언어·시스템 공식 문서를 기준 자료로 사용합니다.</footer>
</body>
</html>
